    "description": "The Big Keyboard: Easy Launcher offers a clean and intuitive home screen layout with quick-swipe shortcuts and more! Make your smart-phone easy with quick call and messaging shortcuts and search hands-free with our smart and easy voice assistant tool. The Big Keyboard: Easy Launcher app also offers helpful tools, such as a magnifier to help you read small text anywhere you go \u2013 like a menu in a dimly lit restaurant. Make your phone feel more comfortable for your eyes and personalized to your interests with built in free wallpaper options and easy access to display and accessibility settings.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTop Features: \r\n\r\nNew Home Screen Experience \u2013 Intuitive Design & Quick Shortcuts \u2013  \r\n\r\nJust Swipe Right \r\n\r\nBig Keyboard \u2013 Up to 70% Larger Keyboard - Say No to Typos \r\n\r\nHands Free Voice Assist \u2013 Easily Search Hands Free \r\n\r\nLight Up & Magnify \u2013 Great for Reading Menus & Small Print \r\n\r\nEasy Shortcuts & Tools \u2013 Find What You Need \r\n\r\nFun Wallpapers \u2013 Personalize Your Phone Backgrounds \r\n\r\nCalculator \u2013 & Other Helpful Tools at Your Fingertips \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIntuitive Home Screen Layout - We are not your average, boring large keyboard app. The  \r\n\r\nBig Keyboard: Easy Launcher app gives you more so you can get the most out of  \r\n\r\nyour device. The Big Keyboard: Easy Launcher offers a custom home screen  \r\n\r\nexperience that is clean and intuitive and sets up your phone for easy access  \r\n\r\nshortcuts to your favorite and most used features. No more searching through your  \r\n\r\nphone to find what you need. \r\n\r\n \r\nType Easier - We make it easy to connect with loved ones with our robust, big and  \r\n\r\neasy keyboard that makes embarrassing typos a thing of the past. It also can help  \r\n\r\nyou type faster since you no longer have to squint and hesitantly tap with one  \r\n\r\nfinger. The setup is quick with a couple easy taps. You can set the keyboard up to  \r\n\r\n70% larger than your tiny default keyboard. We give you the power to choose how  \r\n\r\nbig is right for you! You can change the size of your keyboard during set up or at  \r\n\r\nany time to make it larger or adjust it down to fit your exact typing needs.  \r\n\r\n \r\nSearch Smarter - Smartphones are our vehicle to access the rest of the world. We  \r\n\r\nare constantly using them to search the web and get answers fast. We deliver an  \r\n\r\neasier search experience with a bigger keyboard and hands-free voice search.  \r\n\r\nSimply tap, talk and search. We also provide suggested searches to help you find  \r\n\r\nwhat you are looking for faster and more effectively.  \r\n\r\n \r\nStop Squinting \u2013 We understand that our phone can also be used as a resource to  \r\n\r\nhelp see the world better, literally. No more struggling to read tiny menu print in  \r\n\r\ndark, dimly lit restaurants. The Big Keyboard: Easy Launcher app comes equipped  \r\n\r\nwith an easy phone magnifier & flashlight. Just hover your phone over a menu, like  \r\n\r\na magnifying glass and tap on the flashlight button if needed.  \r\n\r\n \r\nLove Your Phone - Your phone is a reflection of you! We offer free wallpapers that  \r\n\r\nyou can use to personalize your phone background. When it comes to your phone,  \r\n\r\nyou should never have to choose between function and fun. With the Big Keyboard:  \r\n\r\nEasy Launcher app, you never have to settle. \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDon\u2019t Be a Stranger - Let us know how we are doing. We are constantly looking for  \r\n\r\nfeedback to make the next versions even better. Keep the Big Keyboard: Easy  \r\n\r\nLauncher app team updated and let us know what you think. We hope you love it! \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBig Keyboard. Easy Phone. Better Life.",
